    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">Every walk is an assignment. The editor of a small district paper sends a telegram: one ordinary thing to shoot, with a twist. Shoot it, caption it, and on Sunday the week\'s frames come out as an issue. 1271 assignments: three years of daily walks without a repeat.</string>
    <string name="privacy">Everything stays on this phone. No account, no internet, no ads.</string>

    <!-- The editor's red pencil. -->
    <string-array name="remark_first">
        <item>First frame. Welcome to the staff.</item>
        <item>Set. That\'s how it starts.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_plain">
        <item>Set. To press.</item>
        <item>Good. Exactly what was asked.</item>
        <item>That\'ll do. Next.</item>
        <item>Clean frame. Approved.</item>
        <item>Readers will like this one.</item>
        <item>Not bad at all.</item>
        <item>To the issue, no notes.</item>
        <item>Would have walked past it myself. Good.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_fallback">
        <item>The «or» counts. Into the issue.</item>
        <item>Not exactly that, but honest. Set.</item>
        <item>Fine. The exact one next time.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_quick">
        <item>Fast! Barely sent the telegram.</item>
        <item>That was quick. Set.</item>
        <item>Into the next run already.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_late">
        <item>Late, but the frame is good.</item>
        <item>Took your time. Worth it.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_night">
        <item>Shooting at night now? Set.</item>
        <item>Night shift. Approved.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_weather">
        <item>In that weather? Respect. Set.</item>
        <item>The weather made the frame.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_case">
        <item>Into the file. The case moves on.</item>
        <item>One more piece of the investigation.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="remark_swap">
        <item>Fine, fine. Here\'s another.</item>
        <item>Picky today. One more, and that\'s it.</item>
        <item>All right. But no more swaps on this one.</item>
    </string-array>

    <!-- Small ads for the gaps. -->
    <string-array name="ads">
        <item>BOOT POLISH «MIRROR». Shines in any weather. Ask at the kiosk.</item>
        <item>LOST: an umbrella, black, opinionated. Reward: a kind word.</item>
        <item>FOR SALE: a bicycle bell, loud. Owner moved to a quieter street.</item>
        <item>WANTED: a sunny Sunday. Will trade for two grey Tuesdays.</item>
        <item>THE BAKERY on the corner bakes at six. Follow your nose.</item>
        <item>PIGEONS of the district: please stop sitting on the monument.</item>
        <item>WATCH REPAIR. Time not included.</item>
        <item>FOUND on a bench: one mitten, left. Waiting for the right one.</item>
        <item>KEYS CUT while you wait. Doors not included.</item>
        <item>THE LIBRARY is open Thursdays. Bring back the book from 2019.</item>
        <item>WINDOW BOXES planted. Geraniums, opinions, no guarantees.</item>
        <item>CHESS in the park, Saturdays at noon. Bring your own rook.</item>
    </string-array>

